      "privatePressure": "田价底线保护百姓，却会让改桑进度和财政目标下降。",
      "keyLeverage": "设定田价、登记田契和粮市行政规则",
      "defaultPrepare": "拟定田价底线、登记和粮市规则",
      "defaultCommit": "在保证部分改桑进度下执行中等底价",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n3.zhejiang_administration.01",
          "text": "“官仓只够眼前，田契若不成交，桑苗时令便要过去。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.relief_grain_pool",
            "obj.land_deed_pool"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_administration"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n3.zhejiang_administration.02",
          "text": "“底价可以立，但立得太高，谁补大户不肯出的那部分粮？”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.relief_grain_pool",
            "obj.land_deed_pool"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_administration"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.n3.zhejiang_administration.03",
          "text": "“各县登记必须用同一口径，不能一处叫借粮、一处叫买田。”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.relief_grain_pool",
            "obj.land_deed_pool"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_administration"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "郑泌昌必须在田价、改桑时令与官仓余粮之间形成一份能执行的议案。任何底价都意味着有人要补足差额。",
